  "remarks": "One of the leaders of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. Participated in the seizure and occupation of the regional administration in Donetsk in 2014. Until 4 September 2015, he was the so-called Deputy Chairman of the so-called “People’s Council” of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. Since 4 September 2015, he has been so-called “Chairman” of the so-called “People’s Council of the Donetsk People’s Republic”. So-called “acting Head of the Donetsk People’s Republic” after 7 September 2018. So-called “Head of the Donetsk People’s Republic” following the so-called elections of 11 November 2018 and 8 to 10 September 2023.",
